# Tells the session this unit was renamed and how to move an install, because
# the platform can't rename an installed plugin (ADR-1390).
cat <<'NOTICE'
meow-method is now meow-flow. This copy is a stub with no skill and no paw.
Move the install with:

  claude plugin install meow-flow@meowpaw
  claude plugin uninstall meow-method@meowpaw

The release after meow-flow 0.31.0 removes this stub.
NOTICE
